<title>USA: TABLE - NITROS says changes name.</title>
<headline>TABLE - NITROS says changes name.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>NITROS Franchise Corp said it changed its name to Algorhythm Technologies Corp.</p>
<p>In May, NITROS had changed its name from DigiMedia USA Inc when it merged with the old NITROS Franchise Corp.</p>
<p>On July 21, Telephonetics International Inc, a provider of customized digital-audio content for the telephone, said it acquired a controlling interest in NITROS.</p>
</text>
